<title>USA: Continental Homes Q2 net new orders fall.</title>
<headline>Continental Homes Q2 net new orders fall.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Homes Holding Corp said the total sales volume of consolidated net new orders decreased three percent in the second quarter compared with a year-ago.</p>
<p>It said it delivered 1,145 new homes in the second quarter, an 11 percent jump over last year.</p>
<p>The company's backlog of sold, but undelivered homes at November 30 increased four percent to 1,684 homes with a sales value of about $240,080,000 compared with 1,692 homes valued at $229,934,000 at November 30, 1995.</p>
</text>
